# oracle: compute pair/local with pN for pair gran/hooke/history (native single_extra 10: the normal and tangential forces, vn and vt) on 10 spheres under gravity-free contacts (w172pl_hooke.data, generated, newton on, boundary f f f): dump local every 20 steps of 100, with the shear history of the contacts (native: b332f28 lmp, GRANULAR package)
# oracle-inputs: w172pl_hooke.data
# oracle-files: w174mx_pn_gran_hooke_history.local
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-12 atomrel=1e-8 filerel=1e-8
atom_style      sphere 1
atom_modify     map array
comm_modify     vel yes
units           si
neighbor        2 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0
timestep        1e-4
boundary        f f f
read_data       w172pl_hooke.data
fix             integr all nve/sphere
pair_style      gran/hooke/history 10000.0 NULL 200.0 NULL 0.5 1
pair_coeff      * *
compute         pl all pair/local dist eng force fx fy fz p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7 p8 p9 p10 cutoff radius
dump            d all local 20 w174mx_pn_gran_hooke_history.local index c_pl[*]
dump_modify     d format float %.15g
thermo_style    custom step ke
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             100
